<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00481/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一根19██年生产的████牌跳绳，当被人类使用时会穿过使用者腿部。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>高级研究员Dr.Water Bottle家中。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>保存在Site-CN-64的低价值异常物品仓库中。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>我可以保证我在员工体育考核中从来没有用过这东西！</em><br /></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p>――高级研究员Dr.Water Bottle</p>
</div>
<p><em>这东西又穿不过裤子，有什么用？</em><br /></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p>――RAISA工程师Cloud Finder</p>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00481" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00481" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00481-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drwaterbottle" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3720105); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3720105&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608408953" alt="Drwaterbottle" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3720105)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drwaterbottle" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3720105); return false;">Drwaterbottle</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1608216559 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">17 Dec 2020 14:49</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00172/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>项目样式为一支黑色激光笔，当使用该项目时，该项目激光所射到的地方会不断产生电火花，直到停止使用该项目。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>泠特工从████商场购得，已证明同批次的激光笔无异常性质。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>泠特工随身携带。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>嗷！嗷嗷！嗷嗷嗷！——被电火花打得嗷嗷直叫的崔特工<br />
别跑哇崔特工，咱们来算算鼠标那会的帐！——一脸邪笑的泠特工<br />
你们站点都这么活跃的吗？——来Site-CN-02出差的陈洛<br />
应该吧&#8230;&#8230;话说这支激光笔很适合远程起爆啊——Dr.Stevenson</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">作者的话</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;点我隐藏</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>[如果有更好的整改意见请私信我呦~]</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00172" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00172" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00172-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/freezingheart" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6401769); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6401769&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608408953" alt="Freezingheart" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6401769)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/freezingheart" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6401769); return false;">Freezingheart</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1588999313 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">09 May 2020 04:41</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00441/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一只█技牌无线鼠标，当持有者将其放入书包尝试前往图书馆时，该鼠标有8█%的概率会瞬间移动至持有者寝室的桌面上并使持有者产生“我又忘了带鼠标”的错觉。该批次产品均有异常现象。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>研究员ENC的寝室<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被研究员ENC在寝室使用<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>当我连续███次去图书馆发现没带鼠标，我就知道这玩意不对劲了——研究员ENC</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00441" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00441" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00441-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/edwardnewtchen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6273721); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6273721&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608408953" alt="EdwardNewtChen" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6273721)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/edwardnewtchen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6273721); return false;">EdwardNewtChen</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1602464155 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">12 Oct 2020 00:55</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
